# Factory remote host

Before any Factory VPS / Cherry / SSH / doctor / workbench / remote-ops
action, read and obey:

- `docs/operator/FACTORY_REMOTE_HOST.md`
- `docs/operator/factory_remote_host_v1.yaml`

Do not discover the host from chat recency, Issues, or branch names.
Use the YAML IPv4, hostname `factory-remote-ops`, deploy root
`/opt/solana-alpha-lab`, and SSH identity basename `id_ed25519_factory`.

SSH user is `factory` only. Root SSH is denied. Workbench is
`127.0.0.1:8765` via SSH tunnel only.

Never read, print or commit `local/factory_remote_ops/secrets.env` or
`/etc/solana-alpha-lab/secrets.env`. Never put tokens in receipts.

Owner standing grant for `FACTORY_REMOTE_OPERATIONS_V1`: mutate this
host without micro-approvals. Stop for wallet/signer/tx, a new provider,
or a new atom.
